        <mxCell id="legend-title" value="Fluxo da Arquitetura:" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="465" width="160" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-text" value="1. Client envia request REST para o API Gateway&#xa;2. API Gateway invoca a Lambda de processamento&#xa;3. Lambda lê/grava dados no DynamoDB&#xa;4. Evento do DynamoDB publica mensagem no SNS&#xa;5. SNS encaminha a mensagem para a fila SQS&#xa;6. SQS dispara a Lambda Consumer para processar a mensagem" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="490" width="370" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

